    {"type":"text","id":"d2_nc_t","x":60,"y":1062,"width":1400,"height":22,"text":"⚠ 秒杀消费者仅本地事务(非分布式)：扣 DB 库存后若 trade 提交失败，消息重投会再次扣减；最终一致性依赖 uk_seckill_user 唯一键 + 订单状态幂等兜底。","originalText":"⚠ 秒杀消费者仅本地事务(非分布式)：扣 DB 库存后若 trade 提交失败，消息重投会再次扣减；最终一致性依赖 uk_seckill_user 唯一键 + 订单状态幂等兜底。","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":300027,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25}
